# Title: Renamed Visual Studio Code Tunnel Execution
# ID: 2cf29f11-e356-4f61-98c0-1bdb9393d6da
# Status: test
# Level: high
# Author: Nasreddine Bencherchali (Nextron Systems)
# Date: 2023-09-28
# Tags: attack.command-and-control, attack.t1071.001, attack.t1219
# Description: Detects renamed Visual Studio Code tunnel execution. Attackers can abuse this functionality to establish a C2 channel
# Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

((((NOT _exists_:OriginalFileName AND CommandLine:*.exe tunnel) OR ((CommandLine:*.exe tunnel* AND CommandLine:*--accept-server-license-terms*)) OR ((CommandLine:*tunnel * AND CommandLine:*service* AND CommandLine:*internal-run* AND CommandLine:*tunnel-service.log*))) AND NOT (((Image:*\\code-tunnel.exe OR Image:*\\code.exe)))) OR ((ParentCommandLine:* tunnel AND Image:*\\cmd.exe AND (CommandLine:*/d /c * AND CommandLine:*\\servers\\Stable-* AND CommandLine:*code-server.cmd*)) AND NOT (((ParentImage:*\\code-tunnel.exe OR ParentImage:*\\code.exe)))))
